@OrderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Create a Valid Order (Notice discount logic: 2 * 60 = 120 -> 10% discount = 108)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Alice Johnson",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Ergonomic Keyboard",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 60.00
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Create an Invalid Order (Empty Items - Caught by Controller validation)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Bob Smith",
  "items": []
}

### 3. Get Order by ID
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get All Orders
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
